 decision made in that area.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-04T10:49:21Z"},{"note":"Summary and analysis of consultation responses added.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-21T15:36:04Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-05T13:30:00Z"}],"closing_date":"2026-03-26T23:59:00.000+00:00","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"featured_attachments":["9434163"],"final_outcome_attachments":["9434164"],"final_outcome_detail":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>The Secretary of State for Housing, Communities and Local Government has decided to implement, subject to Parliamentary approval, the proposal for 4 unitary councils to be established in Devon, Plymouth and Torbay.</p>\n\n<p>This proposal was submitted by:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Exeter City Council</li>\n  <li>Plymouth City Council</li>\n</ul>\n</div>","first_public_at":"2026-02-05T13:30:00.000+00:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"opening_date":"2026-02-05T13:00:00.000+00:00","political":true,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"consultation_outcome","first_published_at":"2026-02-05T13:30:03+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-devon-plymouth-and-torbay","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-devon-plymouth-and-torbay","base_path":"/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-devon-plymouth-and-torbay","content_id":"68e111db-7059-4190-8d53-ea391d7cfdf7","document_type":"consultation_outcome","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-04T10:49:21Z","schema_name":"consultation","title":"Local government reorganisation in Devon, Plymouth 